@page "/"
<PageTitle>Tangent Atlas</PageTitle>

@* The home page is the first section only; the menu leads to a page for each of the others. *@
<section class="ta-hero">
    <div class="ta-container ta-hero-inner">
        <div class="ta-hero-head">
            <h1 class="ta-hero-title">A thermostat for <em>all</em> your money.</h1>
            <p class="ta-hero-subtitle">Paychecks, bonuses, savings, credit cards, 401(k), investments. Set the temperature, and Tangent Atlas keeps your money from running too hot or too cold.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ta-hero-grid">
            <div class="ta-hero-copy">
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Connect your online accounts and manage everything you own and owe from one place. See your real net worth at a glance, then act on it: trade a single stock or an entire index with the same ease.</p>
                <p class="ta-hero-lead">Your house, your rules. Set the rules and every dollar coming in or going out follows them. Sleep at night knowing you have a plan for the future, and when things don’t go according to plan, respond with discipline, not panic.</p>
                <ul class="ta-pains">
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Has your best pick become your biggest bet?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Winners grow. Sometimes they grow too big for your portfolio. Set a limit, and your rules warn you when any stock grows past it.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Need cash fast?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Raise it without abandoning your plan. Every holding comes down together, and goes back up just as easily.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Bonus sitting in checking?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Pay the cards, top up savings and invest the rest, in the order you choose.</span>
                    </li>
                    <li>
                        <span class="ta-pain-question">Why buy the fund when you can own the index?</span>
                        <span class="ta-pain-answer">Your own personal index: every share in your name, at your own broker, set to the risk you choose.</span>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <RulesPanel />
        </div>

        <div class="ta-page-final ta-home-final">
            <p class="ta-page-close">Keep your bank, your broker and your stocks.</p>
            <AuthorizeView>
                <NotAuthorized>
                    <a href="/signup" class="ta-btn ta-btn-primary ta-btn-large">Sign up</a>
                </NotAuthorized>
            </AuthorizeView>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
